# @context: Environment configuration
# @purpose: Required env vars for development; all VITE_* prefixed vars exposed to client bundle
# @security: VITE_* vars are bundled into the client — DO NOT put secrets here
# @config-matrix:
#   VITE_MAPTILER_API_KEY  — Required for MapTiler maps (dev/staging/prod: same key pattern)
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL      — Optional: Supabase project URL (dev: local mock, staging/prod: real URL)
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY — Optional: Supabase anon key (dev: local mock, staging/prod: real key)
#   GEMINI_API_KEY         — Optional: Google Generative AI API key (server-side only)
#   DISABLE_HMR            — Optional: "true" disables Vite HMR (used in AI Studio)
#   VITE_API_URL           — Optional: Backend API base URL (defaults to '/api')
VITE_MAPTILER_API_KEY=JNCQIsX7HW4jPDQX491R
